# Styling rules

Detail: [docs/knowledge/ui/README.md](../docs/knowledge/ui/README.md), [fe-shadcn-ui.mdc](./fe-shadcn-ui.mdc)

## Approach

- ❌ Scattered one-off `.css` / `.module.css` per component (unless global tokens or third-party override)
- ✅ Tailwind utility classes for layout and spacing
- ✅ `cn()` from `@/core/lib/utils` (clsx + tailwind-merge) for conditional classes
- ✅ **CVA** (`class-variance-authority`) for component variants (size, intent, state)

## Components

- Reuse Shadcn primitives in `components/ui/` or `@repo/ui/*` before custom markup
- Cross-app styling primitives → `packages/ui`
- Dark mode via `next-themes` / `attribute="class"` — see root layout providers

## Accessibility

- Pair with [web-design-guidelines](../skills/web-design-guidelines/SKILL.md): labels, focus, keyboard for interactive UI
